# Per-Dockerfile .dockerignore for gateway/demo-gha/Dockerfile.
# BuildKit picks this up when building with `-f gateway/demo-gha/Dockerfile`,
# overriding the repo-root .dockerignore (which excludes `testing/` for the
# .NET / SPA component builds that don't need the test corpus).
#
# This image's whole purpose is to bake the demo bundle under
# testing/fixtures/gha/demo/ into /home/wiremock/mappings/, so we explicitly
# include that path. Everything else stays excluded so the build context
# remains tiny (a few hundred KB).

# Default: exclude everything in the context (the repo root).
**

# Re-include the demo bundle's directory chain.
!testing
!testing/fixtures
!testing/fixtures/gha
!testing/fixtures/gha/demo
!testing/fixtures/gha/demo/**

# Re-include the Dockerfile + its sibling ignore file so BuildKit can
# reference them.
!gateway/demo-gha/Dockerfile
!gateway/demo-gha/Dockerfile.dockerignore
